I can't believe it.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.790
This retainer thing can control people?

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:06.080
They sold for less than a thousand yen in the beginning,

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:10.620
but now they go for upwards of six million yen.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:13.540
Six million yen?! For something like this?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.250
Still, that doesn't mean it actually works.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:21.290
Yeah. That's why I wanna test it out.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.200
You've got two?

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.200
I bought them before the price went up.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.950
You're gonna test it by making me your slave?

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:33.910
No.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:37.700
What I want is a partner and insurance.

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.200
A partner and insurance?

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.290
Yeah.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:45.450
If you lost and the SCM turned you into a slave,

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:45.450
how would you escape?

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.700
Just take it out, right?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:51.410
Unfortunately, it doesn't work that way.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:55.700
You can temporarily remove the SCM,

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:55.700
but that won't stop its effects.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:57.750
If you leave it out long enough,

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:02.450
your amplified sense of obligation

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:02.450
will compel you to put it back in.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.870
Almost like you're addicted to it.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.450
What if I force myself to go without it?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.620
The device exerts a strong influence on your brain.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:16.870
At best, you'd probably go crazy

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:16.870
or take some mental trauma.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:22.500
The only way to stop being a slave

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:22.500
is to get your master to release you verbally.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:26.910
But nobody's going to get a slave

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:26.910
just to let them go that easy.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.790
That's where this comes in.

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.250
I've got ten million yen in this account.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.250
Yuuga Ohta

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.250
Bank Account

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.500
This is my insurance.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:38.330
If I end up someone else's slave,

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:38.330
I want you to get them to release me.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.790
Why me...?

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.540
I'm gonna use this SCM and go dueling.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.620
But just so you know, I'm not gonna lose.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:51.540
But, worst case scenario...

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.910
Worst case scenario, I just so happen to lose...

00:17:55.040 --> 00:18:00.410
I need a partner who will beat the person who beat me,

00:17:55.040 --> 00:18:00.410
and release me from slavery!

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:06.450
I felt it when I met you.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:12.790
Your intelligence and initiative, and your sheer guts.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:15.410
I know I can entrust everything to you!

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.830
But we've basically just met.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.870
Time doesn't matter.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.410
I trust you.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.450
Take this SCM and that bank book.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.080
You want a slave that bad?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.950
I'm a little interested in the slave thing,

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.950
but that's not why I'm doing this.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.290
I know you'll understand.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:40.000
I want to test myself.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:44.200
It might be dangerous,

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:48.000
but if I use this SCM,

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:48.000
I can have some really close battles.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:52.500
Then, I can test the limits of my abilities!

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.370
Test yourself..

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.160
You understand, right, Eia?

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.660
I think I do, a little.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.660
Then let's go, together.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.580
I've always had this pent-up energy.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:41.620
I was really just waiting for a spark...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.250
...to make me explode.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:50.830
You...

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.330
...are such an idiot.

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:56.580
That's why I need someone smart, like you!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.830
Thanks.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:04.330
Somewhere along the way,

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:04.330
I started half-believing that crazy story.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.000
Yuuga Ohta saw right through me.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:12.830
He saw something inside me I couldn't get out...

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:16.830
and knew we were kindred spirits.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:24.040
But I would soon come to regret meeting him

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:24.040
with all my heart.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.620
I wish I could go back.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.700
Back to the time before I met Yuuga,

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.700
back before I found out...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.540
...about the Devil's device.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.870
The Master cannot command the Slave

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.870
to commit an action that would lead to death.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:42.000
The Master cannot manipulate the emotions of the Slave.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:48.120
The orders must be within the Slave's abilities.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.620
Huh.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.290
Hey.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.620
Punch yourself in the face. Hard.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:56.540
Huh?

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.080
C'mon. Do it now.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:58.870
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.620
Does it hurt?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.790
Yes, it hurts...

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.290
Aww, you dropped my juice.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.660
Okay, for that, punch yourself again.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.450
That was weak. Harder!

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.580
You really do what I say.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:34.790
This SCM is the best!

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:43.000
Please...

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.000
Forgive me...

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:01.000
-choice-

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:42.410
-shackles-
